            "review_title": "Review at Anh Út - Mì Quảng Trộn - Mì Quảng Ngon",
            "review_text": "LIENMINH100DON\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nFirst Time Experiencing Mixed Quang Noodles - Great\nOct 2023 • Friends\nThis is my first time experiencing Mi Quang, but it's mixed Quang noodles. The preliminary assessment of the toppings is no different from Quang noodles with water but, as if afraid of Quang noodles, sprouts have baby mustard greens, pork, shrimp, quail eggs, etc. including Quang rib noodles, Quang frog noodles. However, in Quang Nam, I got to experience Quang Noodles with the restaurant's special mixed sauce, an interesting experience. The delicious mixed sauce is a new experience for Quang noodles, but does not lose the flavor of Quang noodles. Noodles chose the special mixed Quang noodles with meat, shrimp, quail eggs, Ly Son fish cakes and a delicious crispy fried rice paper roll.\n- However, the shop in the alley is a bit crowded, with a small space of about 20 seats. Open space without air conditioning is also a limitation.\n- The service staff is lovely but there are still a few orders.\nOverall rating is 9.0 points. Delicious food with a variety of central dishes.\nThe location of the alley is a bit difficult to find 7.5!\nEnthusiastic service 8.5 but free iced tea for an additional 0.5!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 4, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
